  "description": "Vali-Duration is a lightweight .NET library providing a high-precision decimal-based duration value type. Supports arithmetic operators (+, -, *, /), comparison operators, implicit conversions to/from TimeSpan, unit-based factories and conversions, and human-readable formatting.",
