  "releaseNotes": "Vali-Duration v1.1.0 — add IParsable<ValiDuration>/IFormattable via the shared DurationStringParser. Updated Vali-Time dependency to 1.1.0. No breaking changes.\n\n            Vali-Duration v1.0.0 — initial release: ValiDuration struct with decimal precision, all arithmetic and comparison operators, TimeSpan interop, unit factories (FromHours, FromMinutes, etc.), As(TimeUnit) conversion, and Format() output.",
